    {
        "content": "<p>Is the following failure expected?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myLT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myLT</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myProp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HasMyProp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">r</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myNat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">hasMyProp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myProp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">r</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HasMyProp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myLT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HasMyProp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myLT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- works as expected</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: failed to synthesize</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  HasMyProp fun x1 x2 =&gt; x1 &lt; x2</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">Hint: Additional diagnostic information may be available using the `set_option diagnostics true` command.</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">trace: [Meta.synthInstance] ❌️ HasMyProp fun x1 x2 =&gt; x1 &lt; x2</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  [Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ no instances for HasMyProp fun x1 x2 =&gt; x1 &lt; x2</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    [Meta.synthInstance.instances] #[]</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  [Meta.synthInstance] result &lt;not-available&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">trace: [Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ LT myNat</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  [Meta.synthInstance] ✅️ new goal LT myNat</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    [Meta.synthInstance.instances] #[@Std.PreorderPackage.toLT, instLTMyNat]</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  [Meta.synthInstance.apply] ✅️ apply instLTMyNat to LT myNat</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    [Meta.synthInstance.tryResolve] ✅️ LT myNat ≟ LT myNat</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">    [Meta.synthInstance.answer] ✅️ LT myNat</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  [Meta.synthInstance] result instLTMyNat</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">synthInstance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">HasMyProp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 590908459,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1777151464
