    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"933054\">Snir Broshi</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/270676-lean4/topic/Typeclass.20synthesis.20fails.20with.20.28.C2.B7.20.3C.20.C2.B7.29/near/590910299\">schrieb</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myLT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LT.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">with_reducible_and_instances</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- failed-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">substring</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myLT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LT.lt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">with_reducible</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I wouldn't expect this to be an issue in typeclass search, since that should use <code>with_reducible_and_instances</code> transparency</p>",
        "id": 590910659,
        "sender_full_name": "Moritz Roos",
        "timestamp": 1777153617
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>i think the issue is, that it simply is never tried smh</p>",
        "id": 590910701,
